@startuml
'==== Title ====
title US008 - "As an Administrator, I want to register a new city in the system. %n() A city must be in a country." - SSD
hidefootbox

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953

autonumber
autoactivate off

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "MiteLovers" as System

Admin -> System: I want to register a new city
activate System
System --> Admin: Please choose a country and provide the city name

System -> System: getAllCountries()
System --> Admin: listOfCountries

Admin -> System: select country; enter cityName
System --> Admin: confirm selection

Admin -> System: RegisterCityForm(countryName, cityName)
System --> Admin: City registered (or error)
deactivate System

@enduml